  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "s01",
      "narration": "Reviews in spreadsheets and notes scattered across emails? Hi, I'm Maria from the Sloneek team, and I'll show you performance evaluation.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_company_performance_evaluation",
          "value": "15000"
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "800"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_company_performance_evaluation",
        "url_contains": "/app/dashboard"
      },
      "part": 1,
      "part_title": "Introduction",
      "hold_after_ms": 400
    },
    {
      "id": "s02",
      "narration": "Evaluation is built on positions and their competencies. Managers evaluate their direct reports, and people can also evaluate themselves.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_company_performance_evaluation",
          "before_ms": 1500
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_company_performance_evaluation",
        "url_contains": "/app/dashboard"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s03",
      "narration": "In the left menu, I click Performance evaluation. Here you see all review cycles, their status, and their completion rate.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_company_performance_evaluation",
          "before_ms": 600
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "slnk-positions-evaluation-list [data-cy=tableRow]",
          "value": "15000"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "slnk-positions-evaluation-list table thead",
          "before_ms": 400
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "slnk-positions-evaluation-list [data-cy=tableRow]",
        "url_contains": "/app/performance-evaluation/positions-evaluation/all"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s04",
      "narration": "The filters above the table quickly separate drafts, ongoing cycles, cycles ready to launch, and completed ones.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "slnk-positions-evaluation-status-filter",
          "before_ms": 400
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "slnk-positions-evaluation-status-filter button:text-is(\"Completed\")",
        "url_contains": "/app/performance-evaluation/positions-evaluation/all"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s05",
      "narration": "Let's start with positions. The Manage positions button opens an overview of job positions and their competencies.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "button:has-text(\"Manage positions\")",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "button:has-text(\"Manage positions\")",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "tr:has-text(\"Customer Support Specialist\")",
          "value": "15000"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "h5:text-is(\"Positions and competencies\")",
        "url_contains": "/app/performance-evaluation/positions"
      },
      "part": 2,
      "part_title": "Positions and competencies"
    },
    {
      "id": "s06",
      "narration": "For each position, you see how many people hold it and how many competencies its competency model contains.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "table thead",
          "before_ms": 400
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "tr:has-text(\"Customer Support Specialist\")",
        "url_contains": "/app/performance-evaluation/positions"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s07",
      "narration": "I'll open the Customer Support Specialist position. At the top are the name and the job description, which the employee sees too.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "tr:has-text(\"Customer Support Specialist\")",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "tr:has-text(\"Customer Support Specialist\")",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "input#name",
          "value": "15000"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "slnk-common-card:has(slnk-common-editor)",
          "before_ms": 500
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "slnk-common-card:has(slnk-common-editor)",
        "url_contains": "/app/performance-evaluation/positions/edit/"
      },
      "voice_after_actions": true
    },
    {
      "id": "s08",
      "narration": "Below is the competency model. Each competency has its own scale, here zero to five, and you can describe each level in words.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "scroll",
          "value": "slnk-common-card:has(slnk-common-open-ai-search-bar-v2)",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "span.text-primary:text-is(\"Setting the verbal description of the scale\") >> nth=0",
          "before_ms": 600
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "span.text-primary:text-is(\"Setting the verbal description of the scale\") >> nth=0",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "div.px-4.pb-4.pt-4:has(input[placeholder=\"Scale description\"]) >> nth=0",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "div.px-4.pb-4.pt-4:has(input[placeholder=\"Scale description\"]) >> nth=0",
        "url_contains": "/app/performance-evaluation/positions/edit/"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s09",
      "narration": "You don't have to invent competencies yourself: type the position into the AI field and AI suggests them. You then assign the position to people in their profile.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "textarea[data-cy=aiTextarea]",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "slnk-common-card-page-header button:has-text(\"Back\")",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "slnk-common-card-page-header button:has-text(\"Back\")",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "nb-dialog-container [data-cy=submitButton]",
          "value": "5000"
        },
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "nb-dialog-container [data-cy=submitButton]",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "nb-dialog-container [data-cy=submitButton]",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "tr:has-text(\"Customer Support Specialist\")",
          "value": "15000"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "h5:text-is(\"Positions and competencies\")",
        "url_contains": "/app/performance-evaluation/positions"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "narration": "Now let's create a new cycle. I click Create and fill in a name, for example Performance review for Q4.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "slnk-common-card-page-header button:has-text(\"Back\")",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "slnk-positions-evaluation-list [data-cy=tableRow]",
          "value": "15000"
        },
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "button:has-text(\"Create\")",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "button:has-text(\"Create\")",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "input#name",
          "value": "15000"
        },
        {
          "type": "type",
          "selector": "input#name",
          "value": "Performance review for Q4",
          "before_ms": 400,
          "delay_ms": 40
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "slnk-positions-evaluation-setup-survey-basic-settings",
        "url_contains": "/setup/survey"
      },
      "part": 3,
      "part_title": "New review cycle",
      "voice_after_actions": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "narration": "The first option adds competencies from the job positions to the questionnaire. The manager always evaluates, and I'll also tick self-evaluation.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "nb-checkbox[formcontrolname=is_copy_competencies_from_position]",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "nb-checkbox[formcontrolname=is_self_review_requested] label",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "nb-checkbox[formcontrolname=is_self_review_requested] label",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "nb-checkbox[formcontrolname=is_self_review_requested] span.custom-checkbox.checked",
        "url_contains": "/setup/survey"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "narration": "Under Targeting, you choose who gets evaluated: the whole company, teams, locations, tags, positions, or specific people. I'll pick selected users.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "slnk-positions-evaluation-setup-survey-targeting nb-radio-group",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "1500"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "nb-radio:has(input[value=\"users\"]) label",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "slnk-positions-evaluation-setup-survey-targeting slnk-common-autocomplete input",
          "before_ms": 600
        },
        {
          "type": "type",
          "selector": "[data-cy=autocompleteSearchInput]",
          "value": "Claver",
          "before_ms": 400,
          "delay_ms": 60
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "slnk-common-autocomplete-option:text-is(\"Claver Thomas\")",
          "before_ms": 600
        },
        {
          "type": "press",
          "value": "Escape",
          "before_ms": 400
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "slnk-positions-evaluation-setup-survey-targeting slnk-common-autocomplete",
        "url_contains": "/setup/survey"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "narration": "In the Timeline, I set the start and end date. The cycle can even start today.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "input[formcontrolname=start_date]",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "nb-calendar-day-cell.day-cell.today",
          "before_ms": 700
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "input[formcontrolname=end_date]",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "nb-calendar-day-cell.day-cell:not(.bounding-month):not(.disabled) >> nth=-1",
          "before_ms": 900
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "400"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "slnk-positions-evaluation-setup-survey-timeline",
        "url_contains": "/setup/survey"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "narration": "I click Next. The review is saved as a draft, and we move on to the questionnaire.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "slnk-common-card-page-header button:has-text(\"Next\")",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "slnk-common-card-page-header button:has-text(\"Next\")",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": ":text-is(\"Select the option to create a questionnaire\")",
          "value": "15000"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": ":text-is(\"Select the option to create a questionnaire\")",
        "url_contains": "/questionnaire"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "narration": "AI can draft the questionnaire for you, or you can start from scratch. I'll choose Start from scratch.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "slnk-positions-evaluation-setup li:has-text(\"Create with AI\")",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "li:has-text(\"Start from scratch\") >> nth=-1",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "li:has-text(\"Start from scratch\") >> nth=-1",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": ":text-is(\"Instruction for self reviewers\")",
          "value": "10000"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": ":text-is(\"Instructions for manager\")",
        "url_contains": "sectionId=instructions"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "narration": "In Instructions, you write separate guidance for the self-evaluation and for the manager. All changes are saved automatically.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "slnk-common-card:has-text(\"Instruction for self reviewers\") >> nth=-1",
          "before_ms": 400
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": ":text-is(\"Instructions for manager\")",
        "url_contains": "sectionId=instructions"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s17",
      "narration": "In All positions, you add questions for everyone being evaluated. I click Add question and type the wording.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "slnk-common-dynamic-menu-item a:text-is(\"All positions\")",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "button:has-text(\"Add question\")",
          "value": "10000"
        },
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "button:has-text(\"Add question\")",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "button:has-text(\"Add question\")",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "type",
          "selector": "input[formcontrolname=text]",
          "value": "How well are you meeting your goals for the past period?",
          "before_ms": 400,
          "delay_ms": 30
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "input[formcontrolname=text]",
        "url_contains": "/questionnaire"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s18",
      "narration": "As the answer type, I choose a scale from one to five. A question can be for the manager only, or for both the manager and the user.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "nb-select#type button",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "nb-option:text-is(\"Scale\")",
          "before_ms": 600
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "nb-select#target_type",
          "before_ms": 600
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "nb-select#type button:has-text(\"Scale\")",
        "url_contains": "/questionnaire"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s19",
      "narration": "Each position has questions from its competency model. You can add your own questions here, too.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "slnk-common-dynamic-menu-item a:text-is(\"Customer Support Specialist\")",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "nb-accordion-item-header h6:text-is(\"Customer communication\")",
          "value": "10000"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "slnk-positions-evaluation-setup-questionnaire-question:has-text(\"Customer communication\") >> nth=0",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "nb-accordion-item-header h6:text-is(\"Customer communication\")",
        "url_contains": "/questionnaire"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s20",
      "narration": "I click Next. The summary shows the name, targeting, dates, and the number of questions.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "slnk-common-card-page-header button:has-text(\"Next\")",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "slnk-common-card-page-header button:has-text(\"Next\")",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": ":text-is(\"Summary\")",
          "value": "15000"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": ":text-is(\"Summary\")",
        "url_contains": "/launch"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s21",
      "narration": "The Launch button starts the cycle, and evaluators get their tasks. For this demo, I'll leave it as a draft.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "slnk-common-card-page-header button:has-text(\"Launch\")",
          "before_ms": 600
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "1500"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": ":text-is(\"Summary\")",
        "url_contains": "/launch"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s22",
      "narration": "Now the results. In the overview, I open the demo review for the third quarter.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_company_performance_evaluation",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_company_performance_evaluation",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=tableRow]:has-text(\"Performance review – demo (Q3 2026)\")",
          "value": "15000"
        },
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "[data-cy=tableRow]:has-text(\"Performance review – demo (Q3 2026)\")",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=tableRow]:has-text(\"Performance review – demo (Q3 2026)\")",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "slnk-positions-evaluation-detail-results",
        "url_contains": "/detail/"
      },
      "part": 4,
      "part_title": "Results",
      "voice_after_actions": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "s23",
      "narration": "At the top, you see the number of participants and the completion rate. The Results table shows who's still missing a type of feedback.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=positionsEvaluationResultUserListTable] tbody tr",
          "value": "15000"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "slnk-common-card:has-text(\"Completion rate\") >> nth=-1",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=positionsEvaluationResultUserListTable] thead",
          "before_ms": 400
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=positionsEvaluationResultUserListTable]",
        "url_contains": "/detail/"
      },
      "voice_after_actions": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "s24",
      "narration": "In the Raters tab, you check who evaluates whom. In the Results table, I click the name of the person being evaluated.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "a[href$=\"/raters\"]",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "1500"
        },
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "[data-cy=positionsEvaluationResultUserListTable] tbody tr:has-text(\"Claver Thomas\")",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "3500"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=positionsEvaluationResultUserListTable] tbody tr:has-text(\"Claver Thomas\")",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "slnk-position-evaluation-report-summary",
        "url_contains": "/user-report/"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s25",
      "narration": "The report shows strengths and areas to improve: here, customer communication leads and independence is the weakest. AI key observations sum it up in words.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "slnk-position-evaluation-report-performance-by-category",
          "value": "20000"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "slnk-position-evaluation-report-summary",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "slnk-common-card:has-text(\"AI key observations\") >> nth=-1",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "300"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "slnk-position-evaluation-report-performance-by-category",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "slnk-position-evaluation-report-performance-by-category",
        "url_contains": "/user-report/"
      },
      "voice_after_actions": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "s26",
      "narration": "Detailed feedback shows the manager's rating next to the self-evaluation. You set the agreed final result with the pencil icon.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "slnk-positions-evaluation-competencies-feedback table",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "slnk-positions-evaluation-competencies-feedback .fa-pencil >> nth=0",
          "before_ms": 400
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "slnk-positions-evaluation-competencies-feedback th:text-is(\"Final result\")",
        "url_contains": "/user-report/"
      }
    },
